251697966130_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7rn_mAq89t8Q7kNvwGjTeqx&_nc_oc=AdnXV23idj5kx6Yk6QdXRSxix8pNTNMAj_FOSGcEr_ne4O6_MzVLLYFIUS5oNS3ekPo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuCiz0PliR9bXZAKCmovF0az0vCmkMCF_SO1pafHUEEZg&oe=69A03D5B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "HUHUHU.png", "id": "2035477956919467", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392314_2035477963586133_3759903070723388888_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0ZDeu5C-S8AQ7kNvwEr5v5C&_nc_oc=AdmRrNDzmVn3Y0rZ-QuZWjsnBULYpgw593JvWKvNgjpJqk-nPe7KZayzbUG6OMydE2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu0bVbsF4oXNn6Lk4NgGMFM2olwCOR31fKHXG2dU4saLg&oe=69A04B25"}, "display_name": "VITRIOL - DEMO", "keywords": ["Physics", "Fast", "Shooter", "Heavy", "Retro"], "long_description": "MARCH FOR YOUR GOD\n\nVITRIOL is a physics based VR movement shooter. Combining speed and visceral combat with the presence and physicality of VR through physics and retro coat of paint. \n\nFast and Loose - Long strides and Heavy Blows churn through the wretched horde with a freedom and ease VR is yet to experience.\n\nHand to Skull - Physics based Enemies and an in-depth elbow estimation system provide a physicality and presence to the combat which enhances gameplay beyond what was previously possible.\n\nBlood, Fire and Pillars of Smoke - Sinners malformed, The Righteous Risen. The Wrath of God in Iron Men. All this scored by a soundtrack that hits just as hard, drowned in a haze just as thick. ", "short_description": "MARCH FOR YOUR GOD\n\nVITRIOL is a physics based VR movement shooter. Combining speed and visceral combat with the presence and physicality of VR through physics and retro coat of paint. \n\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Lee Wilson", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/VitriolDev/Privacy-Policy/blob/main/VITRIOL%20DEMO%20Privacy%20Policy.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publi